WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
At a university, a stranger asked for directions.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A door passed between the two people.
The stranger was replaced.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In the published experiment, around half
of pedestrians noticed the switch.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Noticing and comparing are different tasks.
No miracle cure follows from this.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
When evaluating short meditation audio,
ask: convenient format or proven outcome?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Check the evidence. Try a free 12-minute
baseline before deciding.
